  "summary": "Malicious code in vl-ui-description-data (npm)",
  "details": "Vl-ui-description-data@1.0.0 is an inert placeholder package that squats the vl-ui-* component-library naming convention. It ships a single index.js containing only a comment and an empty package.json with no lifecycle hooks, dependencies, or executable code. The package provides no functional implementation and appears intended to occupy the vl-ui-description-data name within the vl-ui namespace.",
